    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.completion\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\n(Sorry, I'm not sure this is bug or not and should be reported here or not but,)\r\nWhen using `mini.completion` with `noice.nvim`, `info` window is not rendered properly.\r\n\r\n### Neovim version\r\n\r\n0.10.0\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal lazypath = vim.fn.stdpath(\"data\") .. \"/lazy/lazy.nvim\"\r\nif not (vim.uv or vim.loop).fs_stat(lazypath) then\r\n\tlocal lazyrepo = \"https://github.com/folke/lazy.nvim.git\"\r\n\tvim.fn.system({ \"git\", \"clone\", \"--filter=blob:none\", \"--branch=stable\", lazyrepo, lazypath })\r\nend\r\nvim.opt.rtp:prepend(lazypath)\r\n\r\nvim.g.mapleader = \" \"\r\nvim.g.maplocalleader = \"\\\\\"\r\n\r\nvim.opt.number = true\r\n\r\nrequire(\"lazy\").setup({\r\n\t{\r\n\t\t\"folke/noice.nvim\",\r\n\t\tdependencies = { \"MunifTanjim/nui.nvim\" },\r\n\t\topts = {\r\n\t\t\t-- popupmenu = { enabled = false },\r\n\t\t},\r\n\t\tevent = \"VeryLazy\",\r\n\t},\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n\t\t\"neovim/nvim-lspconfig\",\r\n\t\tdependencies = {\r\n\t\t\t{ \"williamboman/mason.nvim\", config = true },\r\n\t\t\t\"williamboman/mason-lspconfig.nvim\",\r\n\t\t},\r\n\t\tconfig = function()\r\n\t\t\trequire(\"mason-lspconfig\").setup_handlers({\r\n\t\t\t\tfunction(server)\r\n\t\t\t\t\trequire(\"lspconfig\")[server].setup({})\r\n\t\t\t\tend,\r\n\t\t\t})\r\n\t\tend,\r\n\t},\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n\t\t\"echasnovski/mini.completion\",\r\n\t\topts = {\r\n\t\t\twindow = {\r\n\t\t\t\tinfo = { border = \"double\" },\r\n\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t},\r\n\t},\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nIt should be rendered properly.\r\n\r\nDisabling `noice.nvim`'s `popupmenu` seems to fix this issue.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/6259812/1d1c1676-db95-41c7-a0ad-53057619602d)\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/6259812/a2dc2f63-7503-4f18-b195-33c77905e3cd\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
