            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\n> Disabling `noice.nvim`'s `popupmenu` seems to fix this issue.\r\n\r\nIndeed, this is a suggested solution here. The 'mini.completion' module works only with built-in completion popup.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
